<</E(Perhaps, things are not meant to work out sornetimes. Sometimes, that's the best that could happen for us, even if we do not understand. We just have to put our trust in the good, hold onto hope with all our heart and move forward. Maybe one day when we look back on this journey we will understand the purpose of all of this. But we are here now and the best we can do is to start where we are, and instead of hoping and wishing things to be different, we can give our best to all that we do and believe that in the end everything will work out the way they are meant to. )/K[ 0]/Pg 42 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
